                                                "example_id": "5e764ba0-c9e5-45e6-852f-0b494ee5b9bc",
                                                "sense_id": "08f815bb-e46c-39ad-bf47-cafeae5d18c4",
                                                "text": "c. 1772, Oliver Goldsmith, letter to Mrs. Bunbury\nThe harpies about me all pocket the pool."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
